{"Django QuerySet slicing does not support negative indexes; queryset[start_offset:stop] with start_offset < 0 raises a runtime error. The new path will crash when enable_advanced_features is on and a negative cursor arrives. Need to clamp to 0 or explicitly reject negative offsets before slicing.": 0.9516404867172241, "OptimizedCursorPaginator expects a numeric sort key, but the endpoint orders by datetime (a datetime object). Its get_item_key() uses math.floor(value), which will raise TypeError when optimized_pagination=true is used. Need to use DateTimePaginator for datetime fields or implement a datetime-aware optimized paginator.": 0.9511090517044067, "Using zcard/zunionstore will raise WRONGTYPE if existing span-buf:s:* keys are still Redis Sets from prior versions, breaking span buffering for in-flight traces. Need to add a type check/migration (convert set\u2192zset or fall back to S* ops until old keys expire) before these Z* calls.": 0.9260187149047852}